<p align="center"><center><h2>Bard's Corner</h2></center></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This section is dedicated to the
creative efforts of our members; images, writings, poetry, songs, whether
relevant to EverQuest or not are welcome here. We encourage our members to be
creative and proudly display anything they wish to share.</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; If you have something you'd like to post
here, email it to me at <a href="mailto:aerich@thelostcabal.org?subject=Bards Corner Submission">aerich@thelostcabal.org</a>.</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>

<p align="left">For now, I've just included some of the images I've made on a
program called Bryce. I like them, I hope you do too.</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">-Aerich</p>
